rectly validates raw byte fields as UTF-8 through next_field(), rejecting invalid UTF-8 even for Vec<u8> fields annotated with serde_bytes. The fix uses next_field_bytes() to preserve arbitrary bytes. The regression test added by this commit deserializes a middle field containing foo\\xFFbar and checks its exact bytes. This is a source-derived plan; no tests were executed.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T00:27:06.062072+00:00"}
